    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AssembleVerse is a multiplayer VR sandbox game where you are tasked with solving your planet's most dire problems! Complete objectives by snapping parts together the same way you would a LEGO set. Pilot your own land, air, and space vehicles. Compete head-to-head in races and battles. Or create a new wacky thing no one has seen before. The only limit is your imagination! Collaborate and share designs with friends online. Build your own sandbox worlds. Experience building like you never have before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in Closed Beta, and not all features are implemented. This Beta is to gain feedback to make each subsystem robust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to share your designs and give us feedback: . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hands to grab and assemble parts. When parts are moved close together, suggestions for where to place the part will appear. Let go to attach the part. Snap parts together just how you would in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited number of designs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motors, pistons, servos, wings, propellers, rockets, and gyroscopes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joysticks and steering wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable avatars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your designs with others </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics playgrounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hundreds of part types </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 40 unique materials </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >immersive 3D environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >interactive characters</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AssembleVerse is a multiplayer VR sandbox game where you are tasked with solving your planet's most dire problems! Complete objectives by snapping parts together the same way you would a LEGO set. Pilot your own land, air, and space vehicles. Compete head-to-head in races and battles. Or create a new wacky thing no one has seen before. The only limit is your imagination! Collaborate and share designs with friends online. Build your own sandbox worlds. Experience building like you never have before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in Closed Beta, and not all features are implemented. This Beta is to gain feedback to make each subsystem robust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to share your designs and give us feedback: . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hands to grab and assemble parts. When parts are moved close together, suggestions for where to place the part will appear. Let go to attach the part. Snap parts together just how you would in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited number of designs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motors, pistons, servos, wings, propellers, rockets, and gyroscopes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joysticks and steering wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable avatars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your designs with others </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics playgrounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hundreds of part types </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 40 unique materials </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >immersive 3D environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >interactive characters</p></li></ul>",
